  decisions: 0000000000000000000000000000000003000000
  altLinesOne:
  - '*I''m glad I took all the supplies there, considering there aren''t any over
    here.*'
  - '*After all, I bet everyone else is taking everything not nailed down anyways.
    Might as well join in.*'
